        <initializer>= 2</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Note, we assume here that void* is related to raw malloc&apos;ed memory and that malloc returns objects at least 4-byte aligned. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>However, this may be wrong, or pointers may be from something other than malloc. In this case, you should specify a real typed pointer or avoid this template.</para>
<para>All clients should use assertions to do a run-time check to ensure that this is actually true. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
